     "breaking": true,
     "migration": "Automatic and stamped. Recorded exclusions cannot be translated -- the replacement has nowhere to put a judgement -- so they travel in the migration stamp as `carriedExclusions` and the Inspector says they are inert. They are preserved rather than acted on, because dropping them on open would be the silent rewrite retirement exists to prevent."
